{"id": "DF_bkZfzeXN", "title": "Video by visionmachina", "description": "Keep moving forward.\n\nFor many, your struggle may go unnoticed. On the surface, it looks like everything is fine—like you’ve got it all together. But beneath that, there’s a storm only you can feel. The weight of it, the quiet battles, the moments when giving up feels easier than going on.\n\nBut still, you move.\n\nNot because the world is watching, but because staying still is not an option. Because even in the dark, your steps create light. Because forward is the only way.\n\nSo take the next step, no matter how small. Breathe through the fear. Walk through the fire. Keep moving—because that’s how you find your way. #thefisherman #ai #aishortfilm #shortfilm \n\nMade with @klingai_official", "channel": "visionmachina", "uploader_id": "71483437226", "uploader": "VISION MACHINA", "timestamp": 1739403249, "like_count": 14, "comment_count": 1, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1004930034815603a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 77.378, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMVDM4oCOl9mAFEZjhHum6jfAd4x64a2uzuKPwNLQnT4fHcAkAByX_Il3qQFFOpkfuMedcZuyS7bD8mxZoVLJ3s.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=AdpYTDExCLEAGUisGvvlIEF1brOh9XBJazksCzstcNHK-4thoJT_vNKkKqoh-3JMu_1g5KDI1OFbcpIzSUPgxuCe&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=LtxkTH6AIfsQ7kNvwFgjYqe&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=aP72YXST3xEV2mZ8OD489Q&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSUu6R_MAs-kZGGH__cw4qmk2fGvgFarrr3WIY8hU0PIg&oe=6AF45F8B", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash